From f2c22bc5fc6dc4ee88aa8119bb029fe9d0bb043f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ayiejosh <132535860+ayiejosh@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 06:16:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 083/294] pco: preload up to 256 dwords of uniform buffer data

64 dwords per buffer left part of glmark2's jellyfish vertex uniforms
(three matrices and a dozen scalars and vectors, padded) in memory. The
shared register size fields hold far more than 256 dwords.

glmark2-es2 through zink, off-screen 800x600, FPS of two runs each,
before -> after: jellyfish 167/167 -> 182/180, the others unchanged.

CTS: uniform buffer sample (4773), robustness list (4025), 5062 list,
loops/indexing/graphicsfuzz list (6428): identical to before.
---
 src/imagination/pco/pco_nir.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/imagination/pco/pco_nir.c b/src/imagination/pco/pco_nir.c
index f12cbf93..b554e7aa 100644
--- a/src/imagination/pco/pco_nir.c
+++ b/src/imagination/pco/pco_nir.c
@@ -1321,8 +1321,8 @@ remat_load_const(nir_builder *b, nir_instr *instr, UNUSED void *cb_data)
  * \param[in,out] data Shader data.
  */
 /* Uniform buffer ranges larger than this stay in memory. */
-#define PCO_UBO_PRELOAD_MAX_DWORDS 64U
-#define PCO_UBO_PRELOAD_TOTAL_DWORDS 128U
+#define PCO_UBO_PRELOAD_MAX_DWORDS 256U
+#define PCO_UBO_PRELOAD_TOTAL_DWORDS 256U
 
 /**
  * \brief Picks the uniform buffer ranges read at constant offsets for the
-- 
